RBSqtbn3Ju40R14kD73yM0cjdRFbXKHwOuxOfFSkGVrtUM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2LBK-fUMFP9Ay4VtzgeJtP9lY9O9E7N3Z5JNs2E7b3Dg&oe=69DCF930"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "OMG_Meta-Store-16x9_LandscapeCover.png", "id": "4269655196684768", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824328_4269655200018101_9081034574483524810_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9AlNVKrkzIcQ7kNvwE0MFu4&_nc_oc=Adq8fI4KiftJntTWpYxHwwnY_1gUuSPk6Meas64hBRqKDlZlFQfOXWQa2bjZbWDoRVk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1sO6N8HBuYxtyBDZdHdEyhnqTaTXwKuoozrJKJleMOgA&oe=69DCF4CD"}, "display_name": "Oh My Galaxy!", "keywords": ["Fun", "Space", "Casual", "Cute", "Puzzle"], "long_description": "Oh My Galaxy! is an immersive puzzle game where you use a cosmic slingshot to fire asteroids at alien invaders that are attacking defenceless planets.                                                                                                                                                                         \n\n{2501985030252967}\n\nUsing hand tracking or controllers, combine the gravitational pull of the planets with the special powers of your asteroids to perform incredible trick shots.\n\n{1467700694699209}\n\nYour goal is to destroy the alien invaders as efficiently as possible. Set great scores to earn more stars, unlocking over 100 levels of planetary puzzles to solve.\n\n{1430533594856670}\n\nPlay in a choice of mixed reality or VR on Quest 3 and 3S, or in fantastic immersive VR on Quest 2, to experience Oh My Galaxy! brought to life in your home or headset.\n\n{2159426988193949}", "short_description": "Bring the cosmos to your home \n\n- Built from the ground up for mixed reality on Meta Quest \n- Intuitive gesture tracking puts real slingshot power at your fingertips. \n- Bring an arcade slingshot space attack into your living room "}]}, "developer_name": null, 